    "description": "3D Galaxy Watch Face: Experience stunning 3D designs for a dynamic look \r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Watch Face Features\r\n\u2022 Date, month and day of the week.\r\n\u2022 Battery\r\n\u2022 Steps Count\r\n\u2022 Customizable Complications\r\n\u2022 Color Variations\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 3D Galaxy Watch Face Customization\r\n\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on Customize option\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 3D Galaxy Watch Face Complications\r\n\r\nTouch and hold display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want\r\n\r\n\u2705 Compatible with all Wear OS devices such as Google Pixel Watch, Samsung Galaxy Watch etc.\r\nNot suitable for rectangular watches.\r\n\r\nThank you!",
